</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>XST_SUCCESS if found; XST_INVALID_PARAM for NULL arguments; XST_DEVICE_NOT_FOUND if the peripheral list is empty; XST_FAILURE if the list contains no association for <computeroutput>Device</computeroutput>. </para></simplesect>
